# Downloaded public data. Not secret, just not ours to redistribute — docs/setup.md says
# where to get it, and scripts/setup_workspace.py takes the path.
data/

# Working notes, local tooling config and browser QA captures. Kept on the machine that
# made them; not part of the product.
.claude/
docs/plan-v2.md
docs/plan-v3.md
HANDOVER.md

# The demo video shot list — production scaffolding, not part of the product. Local only:
# it names scope decisions and dates, and a public repo should carry the app and its
# evidence, not the notes for filming it.
docs/demo-script.md
